# Pendulum Isle (CIPlay pendulum_isle): a low sky island 12 m up; the top, the hall rules, the buried survey bolt, the
# pendulum frame (the generator), the generator room's four plans, the zipline's low end, the shaft warning, the keel
# (zone keel: the plan's done-when, it brings Gravewell Shaft).
island Pendulum Isle
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Keel
zone top
expect step 1
read Pendulum hall rules
expect step 2
dig
expect story surveybolt 1
expect step 3
use framelever
expect story power 1
expect step 4
open Generator room
wait 3
expect step 8
zone low_end
expect step 9
read Keel shaft warning
expect step 10
use shaft
zone keel
storespot 20 -3
expect done
